SC,0008
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1790153295
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AAs Trump and Xi talk, China surges
OL,4,Aahead with its AI ambitions
OL,5,
OL,6,FUlanqab, with its steppes and
OL,7,Fvolcanoes, is an unlikely digital
OL,8,Ffrontier. For years, it has been
OL,9,FChina's official "potato capital". But
OL,10,Fnow its fields have also become
OL,11,Fconstruction sites for a slew of data
OL,12,Fcentres, as Donald Trump and his
OL,13,FChinese counterpart Xi Jinping meet to
OL,14,Fdiscuss AI safety among other things.
OL,16,FHundreds of workers in yellow helmets
OL,17,Fcarry heavy equipment into the building
OL,18,Fsite as welding sparks fly off metal
OL,19,Fscaffolding. Above them huge cranes
OL,20,Fmove with precision to build rooftops,
OL,21,Fwhile men balance on ladders to plaster
OL,22,Fbrickwork.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
