CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1790153295
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABooker Prize judges reveal shortlisted
OL,4,Anovels after selection 'tussle'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut seven books that appeared on the
OL,7,Flonglist in July have been jettisoned,
OL,8,Fand Dame Mary Beard, who chaired the
OL,9,Fjudging panel, said agreeing on the
OL,10,Ffinal six "has been, to put it mildly,
OL,11,Fhard work".
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
